        "t": 736.6518478,
        "r": 538.0375924,
        "b": 716.7313010526316
      },
      "content": "For Service Technician Use Only If an alarm occurs, the machine will enter a failure solving process: The buzzer sounds once per second for 30 seconds. The error code will be displayed. During that time, the drain pump",
